      "from": "mills",
      "playerVisibleAs": "The forklift question is coming; the host nation has been grumbling about theirs. We have a BPA with Harbor Equipment for that, but a BPA is an agreement to take calls, not a promise to fill them. When you call off one, know who you'd go to if they say no."
